%% M6 owner timeline: GET /api/v1/tracking/parcels/{id}/timeline. Editable source for sequence-m6-owner-timeline.svg / .png.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Customer, courier, merchant
    participant GW as API gateway
    participant T as tracking-service
    participant M as MongoDB tracking
    U->>GW: GET /api/v1/tracking/parcels/{id}/timeline bearer JWT
    GW->>T: forward with X-Correlation-Id
    T->>M: find timeline by parcelId
    M-->>T: timeline document
    T->>T: AccessPolicy, sub in ownerIds, courierId, merchantId or staff role
    alt allowed
        T-->>GW: 200 timeline events, no phone, no street
        GW-->>U: 200 JSON
    else not an owner and not staff
        T-->>GW: 404 problem+json, same as an unknown id
        GW-->>U: 404 problem+json
    end
    Note over U,GW: No token gives 401.
